    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**Exceptional Extended Four-Bedroom Semi-Detached Home in a Desirable Donabate Location**\r\n\r\nSituated in a quiet cul-de-sac overlooking a central green, this beautifully presented and extended four-bedroom semi-detached family home offers bright, spacious and well-appointed accommodation throughout extending to circa 133 sq m. Maintained in exceptional condition, the property combines modern convenience with excellent potential for future expansion.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hall, guest WC, utility room, newly fitted kitchen and a bright sunroom leading directly to the landscaped rear garden. The reception area features a striking fireplace, creating a warm and inviting focal point for family living and entertaining. Upstairs, there are four generous bedrooms, including a master bedroom with en-suite, together with a well-appointed family bathroom.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property benefits from a large cobble-lock driveway, a low-maintenance private rear garden and a central green directly to the front. Additional features include gas-fired central heating, double-glazed windows, a fitted alarm system and a C- energy rating. There is also excellent potential to convert the attic, subject to the necessary planning permissions.\r\n\r\nIdeally located within a 10–15-minute walk of Donabate village and train station, the property is close to a wide range of residential amenities, including shops, schools, cafés and transport links. This superb family home is sure to appeal to buyers seeking comfort, space and convenience in a peaceful setting."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hall: 20'5 x 5' 5\"\r\nCeramic tiled floor, wood paneled walls, Phone point, coved ceilings. \r\n\r\nGuest toilet: 4' 8\" x 2' 3\"\r\nWC,WHB, mosaic tiled walls and ceramic floor. \r\n\r\nLounge: 20' 5\" X 13'\r\nFeature fireplace with a gas inset, coved ceilings, bay window, TV point, light Oak wood floors, double doors through to the dining area.\r\n\r\nOpen plan kitchen/dining room: 19' 1\" x 15' 8\"\r\nNewly fitted kitchen with a break fast bar, double oven, gas hob, extractor fan, dishwasher, fridge/freezer, sink,  Velux window, ceramic tiled floor, \r\n\r\nDining area: Light Oak wood floors, cove ceilings, arch through to the sun room. \r\n\r\nUtility room: 5' x 3'\r\nPlumbed for a washing machine and dryer, gas boiler unit.\r\n\r\nSun room: 13' x 7' 9\"\r\nTV point, 2 Velux windows, door leading out to the garden.\r\n\r\nLanding: 12' 9\" x 5' 6\"\r\nHot press, window.\r\n\r\nBedroom one: 13' 9\" x 9' 5\"\r\nWall to wall fitted wardrobes, TV point., Oak laminated wood floor.\r\n\r\nEn-suite: 6' 7\" x 4' 9\"\r\nCorner shower unit, WC,WHB, fully tiled, window. \r\n\r\nBedroom two: 13' x 11' 7\"\r\nFitted wardrobe, Laminated wood floor. \r\n\r\nBedroom three: 8' 5\" x 8' 6\"\r\nFitted wardrobe, Oak laminated floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom four: 9' x 7' 6\"\r\nOak laminated floor.\r\n\r\nBathroom: 7' 2\" X 6'\r\nCorner shower, WC,WHB, tiled floor, part tiled walls, shaving light. \r\n\r\nOUTSIDE\r\nFront, double driveway, lawned, selection of shrubs.\r\n\r\nRear: Private garden with wood paneled walls, lighting, raised beds, tap, sandstone patio, side entrance, shed."
      },
